From d54b589bd38a7de99f1879e299cbdd47de47f196 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cloudy dev <dev@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 21:07:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Cross-platform step 1: CI matrix, portable file names,
 Linux-only FUSE

- CI: build + test on Ubuntu, Windows and macOS; frontend smoke tests
- core: new fsname module (Windows-safe local names, reserved names,
  length limit, OS junk files skipped in folder uploads)
- core: data dir uses data_local_dir (Local, not Roaming, on Windows);
  write_atomic retries the rename on Windows and cleans up its temp file
- fuse-mount: fuser/libc are Linux-only deps; other OSes get a stub binary
- gui: icon.ico/icon.icns and bundle config (Windows build needs icon.ico)
- frontend: Cmd shortcuts on macOS (Backspace there means delete)
- docs: macOS/Windows install notes
